  -----------------------------------------------------------------------
  
  xc                           pbesol
  relativistic                 atomic_zora scalar
  spin                         none
  k_grid                       12 12 12
  sc_accuracy_rho              1d-6
  elsi_restart                 read
  KS_method                    serial
